<item><title>EU tightens pesticide limits for Egyptian produce from January 2027</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/eg/eu-tightens-pesticide-limits-for-egyptian-produce-from-0722a8/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/eg/eu-tightens-pesticide-limits-for-egyptian-produce-from-0722a8/</guid><category>Egypt</category><description>The rules follow 91 EU notifications on Egyptian shipments from January to August, 81% of them involving pesticide residues.</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 10:00:41 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/eg.jpg" length="31241" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/eg.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Dutch Embassy in Cairo closes public premises amid demonstrations</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/eg/dutch-embassy-in-cairo-closes-public-premises-amid-ca6c99/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/eg/dutch-embassy-in-cairo-closes-public-premises-amid-ca6c99/</guid><category>Egypt</category><description>The Foreign Ministry ordered a temporary shutdown, and the embassy says it will notify people with existing appointments about rescheduling.</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 07:40:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/eg.jpg" length="31241" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/eg.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Egypt phone prices rise about 60% as buyers turn to used devices</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/eg/egypt-phone-prices-rise-about-60-as-buyers-turn-to-used-367757/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/eg/egypt-phone-prices-rise-about-60-as-buyers-turn-to-used-367757/</guid><category>Egypt</category><description>The increases have hit budget models as well as high-end phones, and retailers say repeated hikes are slowing sales.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 14:21:54 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/eg/egypt-phone-prices-rise-about-60-as-buyers-turn-to-used-367757/share.jpg" length="42140" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/eg/egypt-phone-prices-rise-about-60-as-buyers-turn-to-used-367757/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Egypt hosts building materials summit as exporters seek overseas buyers</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/eg/egypt-hosts-building-materials-summit-as-exporters-seek-736124/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/eg/egypt-hosts-building-materials-summit-as-exporters-seek-736124/</guid><category>Egypt</category><description>The Convergence 2026 summit will bring about 100 industry, trade and investment leaders from 40 countries to Sharm El-Sheikh for a one-day gathering.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 14:18:35 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/eg.jpg" length="31241" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/eg.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Iraq and Egypt agree to abolish entry visas</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/eg/iraq-and-egypt-agree-to-abolish-entry-visas-21fb1b/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/eg/iraq-and-egypt-agree-to-abolish-entry-visas-21fb1b/</guid><category>Egypt</category><description>The leaders announced the deal in Cairo, but gave no start date or details on which travelers will qualify.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 14:17:03 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/eg.jpg" length="31241" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/eg.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
